    art: 
    arrival: 'Gloria[sad]: A dark room, please. Somewhere quiet.

      And... I
      can''t bear to see my own face.'
    story:
    - 'Gloria[sad]: I sang here once. The night of the big storm. I never finished
      the song.'
    - 'Gloria: The old piano in the ballroom still has my sheet music on it. Fancy
      that.'
    - 'Gloria[happy]: I finished it tonight. Nobody heard but me, and that was enough.'
    checkout: 'Gloria[happy]: Here, my sheet music. Hum it sometime.'
